      "refersTo": "sello-riesgo-verde",
      "description": "Ícono + palabra + color, nunca solo color; tamaños normal y grande. Verde, ámbar y rojo existen solo aquí y en los hallazgos del resultado.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stamps\"><span class=\"ds-stamp ds-g\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm0 18a8 8 0 1 1 0-16 8 8 0 0 1 0 16zm-1.3-5.6-2.9-2.9-1.4 1.4 4.3 4.3 7.3-7.3-1.4-1.4z\"/></svg>Sin signos de riesgo</span><span class=\"ds-stamp ds-y\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 6c3.8 0 7.2 2.1 8.8 6-1.6 3.9-5 6-8.8 6s-7.2-2.1-8.8-6C4.8 8.1 8.2 6 12 6zm0 2c-2.8 0-5.3 1.4-6.6 4 1.3 2.6 3.8 4 6.6 4s5.3-1.4 6.6-4c-1.3-2.6-3.8-4-6.6-4zm0 1.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5z\"/></svg>Conviene vigilar</span><span class=\"ds-stamp ds-r\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 3a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6v9a1.6 1.6 0 1 1-3.2 0v-9A1.6 1.6 0 0 1 12 3zm0 14.2a1.9 1.9 0 1 1 0 3.8 1.9 1.9 0 0 1 0-3.8z\"/></svg>Consulta pronto</span><span class=\"ds-stamp ds-r ds-lg\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 3a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6v9a1.6 1.6 0 1 1-3.2 0v-9A1.6 1.6 0 0 1 12 3zm0 14.2a1.9 1.9 0 1 1 0 3.8 1.9 1.9 0 0 1 0-3.8z\"/></svg>Consulta pronto</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stamps{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}.ds-stamp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid}.ds-g{background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;border-color:rgba(22,101,52,.55)}.ds-y{background:#FEF9C3;color:#854D0E;border-color:rgba(133,77,14,.55)}.ds-r{background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;border-color:rgba(153,27,27,.55)}.ds-lg{font-family:'Varela Round',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:22px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:14px;border-width:2px;gap:10px}.ds-lg svg{width:26px;height:26px}"
    },
